[{"pageContent":"XL\n星澜智能科技有限公司\n员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":1,"lines":{"from":1,"to":3}}}},{"pageContent":"员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度\nE m p l o y e e A t t e n d a n c e , L e a v e & H o l i d a y P o l i c y","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":1,"lines":{"from":3,"to":4}}}},{"pageContent":"模拟公司制度 · 仅供技术演示\n文件编号：XL-HR-2026-01\n版本：V1.0\n生效日期：2026 年 1 月 1 日","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":1,"lines":{"from":5,"to":8}}}},{"pageContent":"生效日期：2026 年 1 月 1 日\n适用范围：星澜智能科技有限公司全体正式员工、试用期员工及经合同约定适用的其他人员\n归口部门：人力资源部","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":1,"lines":{"from":8,"to":10}}}},{"pageContent":"归口部门：人力资源部\n本文件为虚构的公司规章制度，用于 PDF 解析、文本切分、向量检索和 RAG 问答测试， 不代表任何真实企业，也不替代所在地法\n律法规或政府发布的实际节假日安排。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":1,"lines":{"from":10,"to":12}}}},{"pageContent":"律法规或政府发布的实际节假日安排。\n第 1 页 / 共 7 页","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":1,"lines":{"from":12,"to":13}}}},{"pageContent":"第一章 \t总则\n第一条 制定目的\n为规范员工出勤、休假、加班和节假日安排，保障员工合理休息权益，维持团队协作与业务连续性，特制定本制度。\n第二条 基本原则","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":1,"to":4}}}},{"pageContent":"第二条 基本原则\n1. 员工休假权利受到尊重，部门负责人应合理安排工作交接，不得无正当理由阻碍员工依法、依规休假。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":4,"to":5}}}},{"pageContent":"2. 请假应遵循“事前申请、逐级审批、完整交接、如实记录”的原则；紧急情况可先口头报备，事后补办手续。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":6,"to":6}}}},{"pageContent":"3. 本制度与所在地强制性法律法规不一致时，以法律法规及政府最新规定为准，并由人力资源部及时更新公司口径。\n第二章 \t工作时间与考勤\n第三条 标准工作时间\n项目 \t安排 \t说明","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":7,"to":10}}}},{"pageContent":"项目 \t安排 \t说明\n工作日 \t星期一至星期五 \t国家法定节假日及公司统一休息日除外\n上午 \t09:00—12:00 \t08:30 后可进入弹性签到时段","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":10,"to":12}}}},{"pageContent":"午休 \t12:00—13:30 \t不计入工作时间\n下午 \t13:30—18:00 \t每日标准工作 7.5 小时","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":13,"to":14}}}},{"pageContent":"核心协作时间 \t10:00—12:00、14:00—17:00 \t除休假、外勤外原则上应保持可联系\n第四条 迟到、早退与缺勤","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":15,"to":16}}}},{"pageContent":"第四条 迟到、早退与缺勤\n因公共交通大范围故障、极端天气或突发公共事件迟到的，员工应及时提供说明，经确认后不计为个人迟到。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":16,"to":17}}}},{"pageContent":"未经批准离岗超过 2 小时且无法提供合理说明的，按旷工半日记录；超过 4 小时按旷工一日记录。\n远程办公不等同于休假。远程办公期间仍应完成考勤并保持工作响应。\n第三章 \t年度节假日与公司假期","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":18,"to":20}}}},{"pageContent":"第三章 \t年度节假日与公司假期\n下表为本模拟制度采用的年度内部安排，具体日期由公司每年 12 月另行发布。涉及调休上班日时，以年度通知为准。\n节日或假期 \t统一休息天数 \t公司安排说明","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":20,"to":22}}}},{"pageContent":"元旦 \t1 天 \t原则上为 1 月 1 日；与周末相连时按年度通知执行\n春节 \t8 天 \t包含法定假日、周末及调休；公司另赠 1 天“返乡关怀假”\n清明节 \t3 天 \t包含法定假日与相邻周末或调休","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":23,"to":25}}}},{"pageContent":"劳动节 \t5 天 \t包含法定假日与调休安排\n端午节 \t3 天 \t全体员工统一放假三天；值班人员另行安排等时调休\n中秋节 \t3 天 \t如与国庆节相连，按年度合并方案执行","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":26,"to":28}}}},{"pageContent":"国庆节 \t7 天 \t包含法定假日、周末及调休\n公司周年纪念日 \t1 天 \t每年 11 月第二个星期五，全员带薪休息\n员工关怀日 \t1 天 \t员工可在本人生日当月任选一个工作日休假","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":29,"to":31}}}},{"pageContent":"重点问答：端午节放假几天？按照本公司模拟制度，端午节统一放假 3 天。 因业务需要参加端午值班的员工，可在假期结束后 60 天内申请等时调休。\n第五条 节假日值班\n第 2 页 / 共 7 页","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":2,"lines":{"from":32,"to":34}}}},{"pageContent":"1. 运维、客户支持及安全岗位可根据业务需要安排值班，值班表应至少提前 7 天公布。\n2. 值班员工应保证电话与工作系统畅通，并按值班清单完成巡检和交接记录。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":3,"lines":{"from":1,"to":2}}}},{"pageContent":"3. 法定节假日工作的薪酬或补休安排，按照适用法律法规执行；公司不得以普通调休替代依法应支付的法定节假日加班工资。\n第 3 页 / 共 7 页","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":3,"lines":{"from":3,"to":4}}}},{"pageContent":"第四章 \t各类请假制度\n第六条 带薪年休假\n累计工作年限 \t法定年假 \t公司福利年假 \t年度合计\n满 1 年，不满 5 年 \t5 天 \t2 天 \t7 天","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":1,"to":4}}}},{"pageContent":"满 5 年，不满 10 年 \t5 天 \t5 天 \t10 天\n满 10 年，不满 20 年 \t10 天 \t3 天 \t13 天\n满 20 年 \t15 天 \t3 天 \t18 天","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":5,"to":7}}}},{"pageContent":"年假最小申请单位为半天。连续休假 5 个工作日以上，应至少提前 10 个工作日申请。\n新入职员工当年度年假按剩余日历天数折算，不足半天的部分不计。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":8,"to":9}}}},{"pageContent":"法定年假按法律规定处理；公司福利年假原则上应在当年使用，最迟可延至次年 3 月 31 日，逾期失效。\n员工离职时，未休假期的处理按照法律规定、劳动合同及公司结算规则执行。\n第七条 病假","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":10,"to":12}}}},{"pageContent":"第七条 病假\n病假半天以内应在上班前向直属主管报备；连续病假 1 天及以上，应提交正规医疗机构出具的诊断、病休或就诊证明。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":12,"to":13}}}},{"pageContent":"一个自然年度内，前 3 个工作日普通病假按基本工资的 100%计发；第 4 至第 10 个工作日按基本工资的 80%计发；超过部分按所在地医疗期及工资规定执行。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":14,"to":14}}}},{"pageContent":"因急诊无法提前申请的，应在具备联系条件后 2 小时内通知直属主管，并在返岗后 2 个工作日内补交材料。\n心理健康就诊与身体疾病就诊适用相同的病假规则，公司对医疗信息承担保密义务。\n第八条 事假","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":15,"to":17}}}},{"pageContent":"第八条 事假\n员工因个人事务确需本人处理时，可申请无薪事假，最小单位为半天。\n单次事假原则上不超过 5 个工作日，全年累计原则上不超过 15 个工作日。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":17,"to":19}}}},{"pageContent":"员工仍有可用年假或调休时，可自行选择优先使用；公司不得强制员工以病假替代事假。\n第九条 婚假\n依法办理结婚登记的员工可享受 3 天带薪婚假，公司另赠 2 天福利婚假，合计 5 天。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":20,"to":22}}}},{"pageContent":"婚假应自登记之日起 12 个月内一次性使用；确因项目原因无法一次使用的，经批准可分两次使用。\n申请时应提交结婚登记证明，涉及个人隐私的信息由人力资源部妥善保管。\n第十条 生育相关假期","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":23,"to":25}}}},{"pageContent":"第十条 生育相关假期\n假别 \t模拟公司标准 \t说明\n产检假 \t按医疗需要安排 \t提供预约或就诊证明，计入正常出勤\n产假 \t158 个日历日 \t含法定产假及公司福利延长假；所在地标准更高时从高执行","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":25,"to":28}}}},{"pageContent":"难产增加假 \t15 个日历日 \t凭医疗证明增加\n多胞胎增加假 \t每增加一名婴儿增加 15 个日历日 \t与难产增加假可按规定合并\n陪产假 \t15 个日历日 \t原则上在子女出生后 90 天内使用","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":29,"to":31}}}},{"pageContent":"育儿假 \t每名员工每年 5 个工作日 \t子女未满 3 周岁期间适用\n哺乳时间 \t每日 1 小时 \t婴儿满 1 周岁前，可合并至上班或下班时段\n第十一条 丧假","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":32,"to":34}}}},{"pageContent":"第十一条 丧假\n配偶、父母、子女或主要赡养人去世，可享受 3 个工作日带薪丧假。\n祖父母、外祖父母、配偶父母或兄弟姐妹去世，可享受 1 个工作日带薪丧假。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":34,"to":36}}}},{"pageContent":"确需异地奔丧的，可根据路程另申请 1 至 2 个工作日路程假。\n第十二条 其他假期\n第 4 页 / 共 7 页","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":4,"lines":{"from":37,"to":39}}}},{"pageContent":"假别 \t天数或方式 \t适用条件\n护理假 \t每年 5 个工作日 \t用于陪护住院治疗的父母、配偶或未成年子女\n考试假 \t每年最多 3 个工作日 \t参加与岗位相关、经公司认可的资格考试","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":5,"lines":{"from":1,"to":3}}}},{"pageContent":"公益志愿假 \t每年 1 个工作日 \t参加经公司登记的公益活动\n工伤停工留薪期 \t按法律法规执行 \t须及时完成工伤报告和认定流程\n公假 \t按实际需要 \t依法参加选举、出庭、履行公共义务等情形","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":5,"lines":{"from":4,"to":6}}}},{"pageContent":"第 5 页 / 共 7 页","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":5,"lines":{"from":7,"to":7}}}},{"pageContent":"第五章 \t加班与调休\n第十三条 加班申请\n1. 公司不鼓励无计划加班。确因业务需要加班的，应由主管在加班开始前提交申请，说明事项、人员和预计时长。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":1,"to":3}}}},{"pageContent":"2. 员工自行延长在岗时间、未产生实际工作成果或未经批准的，不当然认定为公司安排的加班。\n3. 紧急故障处置可事后补办申请，但应保留工单、告警或客户请求等记录。\n第十四条 调休规则","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":4,"to":6}}}},{"pageContent":"第十四条 调休规则\n经批准的工作日延时及休息日加班，可依据实际有效工时生成调休余额。\n调休最小使用单位为 1 小时；单日使用 4 小时按半天、8 小时按一天计算。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":6,"to":8}}}},{"pageContent":"调休原则上应在生成后 6 个月内使用。确因业务原因无法使用的，由人力资源部依法处理。\n法定节假日加班按照法律规定支付报酬，不以调休替代。\n第六章 \t请假申请与审批\n第十五条 申请时限","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":9,"to":12}}}},{"pageContent":"第十五条 申请时限\n请假时长 \t建议提前时间 \t审批人\n不超过 1 个工作日 \t至少提前 1 个工作日 \t直属主管\n超过 1 天、不超过 3 天 \t至少提前 3 个工作日 \t直属主管、部门负责人","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":12,"to":15}}}},{"pageContent":"超过 3 天、不超过 10 天 \t至少提前 5 个工作日 \t部门负责人、人力资源部\n超过 10 天 \t至少提前 10 个工作日 \t部门负责人、人力资源部、分管负责人\n第十六条 标准流程","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":16,"to":18}}}},{"pageContent":"第十六条 标准流程\n1. 提交申请：员工在考勤系统选择假别、起止时间并填写原因。\n2. 工作交接：连续休假 2 天以上须填写交接事项、代理人、紧急联系方式及文件位置。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":18,"to":20}}}},{"pageContent":"3. 审批确认：申请状态变为“已批准”后方可休假；仅提交但未批准不视为完成请假。\n4. 材料补充：病假、婚假、生育假等证明应在规定时间内上传，由人力资源部审核。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":21,"to":22}}}},{"pageContent":"5. 销假返岗：实际返岗时间与申请不一致时，应在返岗当日完成销假或延假。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":23,"to":23}}}},{"pageContent":"紧急请假示例：员工早晨突发高烧无法到岗，应在上班前通过电话或即时通讯联系直属主管， 说明预计请假时间；就医后在系统补交病假申请和就诊材料，而不\n是等到返岗后才首次通知。\n第十七条 审批原则","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":24,"to":26}}}},{"pageContent":"第十七条 审批原则\n审批人应在收到申请后 1 个工作日内处理；不同意时应说明具体业务原因，并与员工协商替代日期。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":26,"to":27}}}},{"pageContent":"同一岗位多人申请同一时段休假时，综合考虑提交顺序、法定假优先级、过往休假情况及业务连续性。\n员工不得伪造请假材料。经查实存在欺诈行为的，公司可依据规章制度处理，但不得公开传播员工医疗隐私。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":28,"to":29}}}},{"pageContent":"第 6 页 / 共 7 页","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":6,"lines":{"from":30,"to":30}}}},{"pageContent":"第七章 \t特殊情形安排\n第十八条 极端天气与公共事件\n政府发布停工、停课或最高等级气象预警时，公司将通过内部系统发布居家办公、延迟到岗或停工通知。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":1,"to":3}}}},{"pageContent":"员工所在地与办公地预警等级不同的，以能够保障人身安全的安排为优先，不得要求员工冒险通勤。\n公司统一安排的临时停工不扣减员工个人年假。\n第十九条 长假前后的工作安排","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":4,"to":6}}}},{"pageContent":"第十九条 长假前后的工作安排\n春节、国庆节前最后一个工作日原则上不安排非紧急的大型发布和系统迁移。\n连续休假 5 天以上的员工，应在离岗前完成书面交接，并取消不必要的生产系统临时权限。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":6,"to":8}}}},{"pageContent":"长假结束后的首个工作日上午，各团队应完成待办事项盘点及值班事件复盘。\n第八章 \t常见问题\n问：端午节放假几天？","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":9,"to":11}}}},{"pageContent":"问：端午节放假几天？\n答：统一放假 3 天。值班人员可在 60 天内申请等时调休；法定节假日当天工作的薪酬按照法律规定执行。\n问：春节一共休息几天？","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":11,"to":13}}}},{"pageContent":"问：春节一共休息几天？\n答：本模拟制度安排 8 天，并另赠 1 天返乡关怀假。实际日期及调休上班日以当年度公司通知为准。\n问：请半天假如何计算？","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":13,"to":15}}}},{"pageContent":"问：请半天假如何计算？\n答：上午半天为 09:00—12:00，下午半天为 13:30—18:00。年假、病假和事假均可按半天申请。\n问：生病来不及提前审批怎么办？","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":15,"to":17}}}},{"pageContent":"问：生病来不及提前审批怎么办？\n答：先在具备联系条件后 2 小时内通知直属主管，再于返岗后 2 个工作日内补交申请及就诊材料。\n问：年假没有休完能否结转？","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":17,"to":19}}}},{"pageContent":"问：年假没有休完能否结转？\n答：法定年假依法处理；公司福利年假最迟可延至次年 3 月 31 日，逾期失效。\n问：在家办公是否需要请假？","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":19,"to":21}}}},{"pageContent":"问：在家办公是否需要请假？\n答：经批准的远程办公不是休假，但仍需考勤、完成工作并保持联系；无法工作的，应按实际情况申请相应假别。\n第九章 \t附则\n1. 本制度由人力资源部负责解释、维护和组织培训。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":21,"to":24}}}},{"pageContent":"2. 各部门可在不降低员工权益、不违反本制度的前提下制定业务值班细则。\n3. 本制度未尽事宜，依适用法律法规、劳动合同及公司后续通知执行。","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":25,"to":26}}}},{"pageContent":"4. 本制度自 2026 年 1 月 1 日起生效，原同类内部规定同时停止适用。\n星澜智能科技有限公司（模拟）\n人力资源部\n2025 年 12 月 15 日发布","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfFile.pdf","pdf":{"version":"unknown","info":{"PDFFormatVersion":"1.4","Language":null,"EncryptFilterName":null,"IsLinearized":false,"IsAcroFormPresent":false,"IsXFAPresent":false,"IsCollectionPresent":false,"IsSignaturesPresent":false,"Title":"星澜智能科技有限公司员工考勤、请休假与节假日管理制度","Creator":"wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6","Producer":"Qt 4.8.7","CreationDate":"D:20260826234806+08'00'"},"metadata":null,"totalPages":7},"loc":{"pageNumber":7,"lines":{"from":27,"to":30}}}},{"pageContent":"2025 年 12 月 15 日发布\n—— 文档结束 · 本文件仅用于 AI/RAG 教学与测试 ——\n第 7 页 / 共 7 页","metadata":{"source":"/Users/keen/Desktop/ai/5-ai-learn-demo/ai-agent-rag-summary-demo/docs/pdfF